r;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">2</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Renang tidak berpengaruh pada paru-paru</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr><tr style=""><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">3</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top;"><span>Renang membuat tubuh cepat lelah</span></td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td><td style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; vertical-align: top; text-align: center;">○</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style="margin-bottom: 18px;"><p style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-weight: normal;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">19.</span> <span style="font-weight: normal;"><span>Tentukan kebenaran pernyataan tentang teks 7 berikut!</span></span></p><table style="width: 95%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-bottom: 16px; margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 6px;"><thead><tr><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 40px;">No</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: left;">Pernyataan</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: center; width: 60px;">Benar</th><th style="border: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 6px 8px; background-color: rgb(229, 231, 235); font-weight: bold; text-align: 